{"id":"mwqa-028","source_id":"论文_002_cs_LG","modality":"chart","difficulty":"visual","question":"Figure 5 中，随着 Top-K 从小变大，ReToken 与 ReKV 的准确率曲线呈现什么相反趋势？","expected_answer":"ReToken在小K时准确率最高，随着K增大、加入更多干扰图像而下降；ReKV在小K时较低，随后随K增大而上升，二者逐渐接近。","evidence_item_ids":["item-p0007-b0011","item-p0008-b0001"],"page_refs":[7,8],"wiki_page_paths":["wiki/analyses/ReToken-Performance-Analysis.md","wiki/entities/ReKV.md"],"required_keywords":["ReToken","下降","ReKV","上升"],"required_keyword_groups":[["ReToken"],["下降","decrease"],["ReKV"],["上升","increase"]],"expected_answerable":true}
